sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant A as API + relay
    participant S as SQL
    participant V as Vault
    participant B as Dapr / broker
    participant W as Worker
    participant O as Observer
    C->>A: SendMessage + bearer
    A->>S: Commit task + publish action
    A-->>C: SUBMITTED (returnImmediately)
    opt Crypto enabled; sealed cache miss
        A->>V: Wrap fresh content key
        V-->>A: wrappedKey
        A->>A: AES-GCM seal with authenticated header
        A->>S: Persist sealed bytes before publish
    end
    A->>B: Publish command (sealed if enabled)
    B-->>A: Publication accepted
    A->>S: Mark published; crash window can duplicate
    B->>W: Deliver subscribed command
    opt Crypto enabled
        W->>V: Unwrap content key
        V-->>W: Content key
        W->>W: Authenticate, decrypt, validate route
    end
    W->>S: Durable admission / stable Workflow start
    W-->>B: SUCCESS; business work may still be running
    W->>S: Commit result + outbox
    W->>B: Publish result (same optional protection)
    B->>O: Independent result subscription
    O->>O: Decrypt if protected; apply monotonic snapshot
    Note over C,O: App-to-app protection across transport. SQL/Workflow remain outside scope.
